<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/title> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://www.essepuntato.it/2012/04/tvc> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> "Fabio Vitali",
                                                                                      "David Shotton";
                                        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Silvio Peroni";
                                        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2012-06-08";
                                        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> """Sometimes, we need to describe scenarios in which someone (e.g., a person) has a value (e.g., a particular role) during a particular time and for a particular context. Four different things are involved in these kinds of scenarios:

1. the entity having some value, e.g. a person or a document possessing a role or a status;

2. the value had by someone, e.g. a role or a status;

3. the time period during which the entity has that value, e.g. from April 2008 to September 2008;

4. the particular context that characterises the act of having that value, e.g. being a member of an institution or an editor of a particular journal.

Thought as natural extension of the Time-indexed Situation pattern (http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/wiki/Submissions:TimeIndexedSituation), this ontological pattern, called Time-indexed Value in Context (TVC), is able to describe these kinds of scenarios."""@en,
                                                                                      <http://dwellonit.svn.sourceforge.net/svnroot/dwellonit/TimeIndexedValueInContext/tvc.png>;
                                        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/title> "The Time-indexed Value in Context"@en;
                                        a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology>;
                                        rdfs:comment "A pattern for the description of scenarios that involve entities having some value during a particular time and within a particular context."@en;
                                        rdfs:label "time-indexed value in context"@en;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time>,
                                                                                <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeindexedsituation.owl>.
tvc:ValueInTime <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> """Having the role \"graduate student\" in a specific time (e.g., now) and context (e.g., \"University of Bologna\")."""@en;
                a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                rdfs:comment "It defines a particular kind of time-indexed situation that represents a hub linking the entity having a particular value, the value itself and the temporal and contextual extents from which the entity-value relationship depends."@en;
                rdfs:label "value in time"@en;
                rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> (<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#Instant>
                                                                                                                          <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#Interval>) ; 
                                                                                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>] ; 
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> tvc:atTime ; 
                                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> ; 
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> tvc:withValue ; 
                                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeindexedsituation.owl#TimeIndexedSituation>,
                                [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> ; 
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> tvc:withValue ; 
                                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> ; 
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> tvc:withinContext ; 
                                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> ; 
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> tvc:withinContext ; 
                                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> (<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#Instant>
                                                                                                                          <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#Interval>) ; 
                                                                                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>] ; 
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> tvc:atTime ; 
                                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>].
tvc:atTime a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
           rdfs:comment "It specifies the particular temporal instant or time period in which the situation takes place."@en;
           rdfs:domain tvc:ValueInTime;
           rdfs:label "at time";
           rdfs:range <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalEntity>;
           rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/situation.owl#isSettingFor>.
tvc:hasValue a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
             rdfs:comment "It links an entity (e.g., a Person) to a particular ValueInTime situation;"@en;
             rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
             rdfs:label "has value"@en;
             rdfs:range tvc:ValueInTime;
             rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeindexedsituation.owl#hasTimeIndexedSetting>.
tvc:withValue a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
              rdfs:comment "It holds the value had by the entity taking part to the situation."@en;
              rdfs:domain tvc:ValueInTime;
              rdfs:label "with value"@en;
              rdfs:range <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
              rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeindexedsituation.owl#forEntity>.
tvc:withinContext a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                  rdfs:comment "It links to the specific context within which the fact of the entity having the value is relevant."@en;
                  rdfs:domain tvc:ValueInTime;
                  rdfs:label "within context"@en;
                  rdfs:range <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                  rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeindexedsituation.owl#forEntity>.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeinterval.owl#TimeInterval> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#Interval>.
rdfs:comment a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
rdfs:label a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<urn:swrl#t> a <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#Variable>.
<urn:swrl#x> a <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#Variable>.
